{"speciesId":356,"names":{"fr":"Téraclope","es":"Dusclops","en":"Dusclops","ja":"サマヨール"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"DUSCLOPS’s body is completely hollow - there is nothing at all inside. It is said that its body is like a black hole. This POKéMON will absorb anything into its body, but nothing will ever come back out."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"DUSCLOPS absorbs anything, however large the object may be. This POKéMON hypnotizes its foe by waving its hands in a macabre manner and by bringing its single eye to bear. The hypnotized foe is made to do DUSCLOPS’s bidding."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It is thought that its body is hollow with only a spectral ball of fire burning inside. However, no one has been able to confirm this theory as fact."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its body is entirely hollow. When it opens its mouth, it sucks everything in as if it were a black hole."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its body is entirely hollow. When it opens its mouth, it sucks everything in as if it were a black hole."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its body is hollow. It is said that those who look into its body are sucked into the void."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its body is hollow. It is said that those who look into its body are sucked into the void."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It seeks drifting will-o’-the-wisps and sucks them into its empty body. What happens inside is a mystery."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Anyone who dares peer into its body to see its spectral ball of fire will have their spirit stolen away."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Anyone who dares peer into its body to see its spectral ball of fire will have their spirit stolen away."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il cherche des feux follets pour les avaler. Ce qui se passe alors dans son corps est un mystère."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It seeks drifting will-o’-the-wisps and sucks them into its empty body. What happens inside is a mystery."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il cherche des feux follets pour les avaler. Ce qui se passe alors dans son corps est un mystère."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It seeks drifting will-o’-the-wisps and sucks them into its empty body. What happens inside is a mystery."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It seeks drifting will-o’-the-wisps and sucks them into its empty body. What happens inside is a mystery."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It seeks drifting will-o’-the-wisps and sucks them into its empty body. What happens inside is a mystery."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il aspire l’âme de ceux qui regardent dans son corps creux où rougeoie son unique œil."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Si alguien mira los fuegos fatuos del interior de Dusclops, perderá su alma irremediablemente."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Anyone who dares peer into its body to see its spectral ball of fire will have their spirit stolen away."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"体の 中で 燃えている 人魂を のぞきこむと 魂を 吸い取られてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son corps est creux. On raconte que celui qui regarde à l’intérieur finira aspiré par le néant."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Su cuerpo está hueco. Se dice que quien mire dentro, será tragado por un agujero negro."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its body is hollow. It is said that those who look into its body are sucked into the void."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体の 中身は 空洞に なっていて のぞきこんだ 相手を 吸いこんでしまうと 言われている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Le corps de Téraclope est totalement creux. Il n’y a rien du tout à l’intérieur. On raconte que son corps est comme un trou noir. Ce Pokémon peut absorber n’importe quoi, mais rien n’en ressort jamais."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dusclops está completamente hueco por dentro. Dicen que su cuerpo es como un agujero negro. Este Pokémon es capaz de absorber cualquier cosa, pero cosa que absorba, cosa que no dejará salir nunca más."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dusclops’s body is completely hollow—there is nothing at all inside. It is said that its body is like a black hole. This Pokémon will absorb anything into its body, but nothing will ever come back out."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体の 中身は 空洞で なにも ない。 ブラックホールの ように なんでも 吸い込み 吸い込まれると 戻って これないと いわれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Téraclope peut absorber des objets de toute taille. Ce Pokémon hypnotise son ennemi en faisant des gestes macabres et en attirant l’attention sur son unique œil. L’ennemi hypnotisé obéit ensuite aux ordres de Téraclope."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Dusclops absorbe todo lo que pilla, al margen del tamaño que tenga. Este Pokémon hipnotiza a su rival moviendo las manos de forma macabra y usando el ojo de manera implacable. Una vez hipnotizado, el enemigo obedecerá."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Dusclops absorbs anything, however large the object may be. This Pokémon hypnotizes its foe by waving its hands in a macabre manner and by bringing its single eye to bear. The hypnotized foe is made to do Dusclops’s bidding."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"どんな 大きさの ものも 吸いこんで しまう。 怪しげな 手の 動きと 一つ目の 力で 相手を 催眠 状態にして 操る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Son corps est complètement creux. Quand il ouvre la bouche, il aspire tout ce qui passe près de lui, à la façon d’un trou noir."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Está completamente hueco. Cuando abre la boca, es capaz de absorber cualquier cosa, como si fuera un agujero negro."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Its body is entirely hollow. When it opens its mouth, it sucks everything in as if it were a black hole."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"体の 中は 空っぽ。 口を 開けると ブラックホールの ように なんでも 吸いこんでしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il cherche des feux follets pour les avaler. Ce qu’il se passe alors à l’intérieur de son corps vide est un mystère."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Busca fuegos fatuos y los absorbe en su cuerpo hueco. Lo que pasa dentro luego es un misterio."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It seeks drifting will-o’-the-wisps and sucks them into its empty body. What happens inside is a mystery."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"さまよっている 人魂を 見つけ 空っぽの 体内に 吸いこむ。 吸いこまれて どうなるかは 謎。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"There are rumors that peeking inside its bandage-wrapped body will cause one to get pulled in through the gaps between the bandages, never to return. I've been too scared to verify."}],"varieties":[{"id":356,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"level-up",1],[20,"machine",0],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"level-up",1],[20,"machine",0],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"level-up"